<ol>
<li>Create a <code>Map</code> with the <code>ArcGISTopographic</code> basem=
ap style and add it to the <code>MapView</code>.</li>
<li>Instantiate a <code>FeatureLayer</code> from a <code>ServiceFeatureTabl=
e</code> and append it to the <code>Map</code>'s operational layers.</li>
<li>In the user-interface, declare an <code>OverviewMap</code> object from =
the ArcGIS Maps SDK for Qt Toolkit.</li>
<li>Assign the <code>MapView</code> to the <code>geoView</code> property of=
 the <code>OverviewMap</code> to connect the <code>MapView</code> with the =
<code>OverviewMap</code>.</li>
</ol>
